&lt;p&gt;There are 8 styles: Hairline, Thin, Light, Regular, Medium, Bold, Black and Heavy.&lt;br&gt;
“Lichtspielhaus Slab” is the third part of a Type Noir Quadrilogy.&lt;/p&gt;
